ence interval [CI] = 1.72--3.40\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"increased with household size (correlation coefficient = 0.90; p = 0.005)\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"PRDOH contacted approximately 340 households by calling randomly selected listed telephone numbers\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"One adult in each household was asked about the number and ages of household members with conjunctivitis.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Conjunctival swabs were obtained from a convenience sample of affected persons from five regions.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"the survey of individual members within the household was based on a convenience sample\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}